OL,3,GNEWSAPM rules out giving Wales
OL,4,Aindependence referendum powers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister has ruled out
OL,7,Fhanding powers to hold a referendum on
OL,8,Findependence to the Welsh government.
OL,10,FAndy Burnham said other UK nations do
OL,11,Fnot have such powers and he did not
OL,12,F"think we can create a different
OL,13,Farrangement for Wales".
OL,15,FHe added that the decision should be
OL,16,Fmade jointly with Westminster, arguing
OL,17,Fthat the UK Parliament has to have a
OL,18,F"say on an issue of that magnitude".
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
