OL,3,GNEWSAPM rules out giving Wales
OL,4,Aindependence referendum powers
OL,5,
OL,6,FWales First Minister Rhun ap Iorwerth
OL,7,Fsaid last week he would seek powers to
OL,8,Fhold an independence referendum,
OL,9,Falthough he ruled out staging one
OL,10,Fbefore the next Senedd election in May
OL,11,F2030.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
